OL,5,G2300 The Great Escape: Capture
OL,6,     FIn this third and final episode
OL,7,     Fthe escapees have fled in all
OL,8,     Fdirections, out of 200 who were
OL,9,     Ftrying to get out, 76 made their
OL,10,     Fescape.
OL,11,G0000 Prisoner: Cell Block H
OL,12,     FBea regains control of the women,
OL,13,     Fwith Sharon and Chrissie unable to
OL,14,     Fresist. Bea asks Pat to plant
OL,15,     Fdrugs in Sharon's cell. Doreen and
OL,16,     FLizzie testify at Caroline and
OL,17,     FVivienne's hearing.
OL,23,VppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppG2/4
