OL,5,G0105 Prisoner: Cell Block H
OL,6,     FVivienne refuses to go to the
OL,7,     Frefuge and insists that Caroline
OL,8,     Fcomes home with her. In solitary,
OL,9,     FRos requests that Paul find out
OL,10,     Fwho the radio belongs to and
OL,11,     Freturn it to them.
OL,12,G0205 Prisoner: Cell Block H
OL,13,     FCaroline and Vivienne try to cover
OL,14,     Fup what they've done, but when the
OL,15,     Fcops question them again, Vivienne
OL,16,     Fconfesses. Police raid the house
OL,17,     Fwhere Tony is staying.
OL,23,VppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppG3/4
