OL,5,G0310 Prisoner: Cell Block H
OL,6,     FPaul bails Tony out, who lies he
OL,7,     Fknew nothing about the drugs.
OL,8,     FSharon is unable to raise bail
OL,9,     Fmoney and is sent to Wentworth.
OL,10,     FVera stirs up trouble between Bea
OL,11,     Fand Sharon.
